OL,3,GNEWSASEND school embraces new 'risky
OL,4,Aplay' scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA special school in Nottinghamshire has
OL,7,Fbecome the first of its kind in the
OL,8,FEast Midlands to introduce a play
OL,9,Fscheme that encourages children to take
OL,10,Frisks.
OL,12,FStaff and parents of pupils at Ash Lea
OL,13,FAcademy in Cotgrave have welcomed the
OL,14,Fintroduction of the Outdoor Play and
OL,15,FLearning (Opal) programme.
OL,17,FDuring lunchtimes, children use
OL,18,Feveryday objects like old pushchairs,
OL,19,Ftyres and wheelbarrows for imaginative
OL,20,Fplay outside, including going down
OL,21,Fhills, climbing trees and building
OL,22,Fdens.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
